    "For each flight at a located spot, this shares the spot, date, duration and flight type — never your GPS tracks or notes. Flights without a located spot are skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für jeden Flug an einem verorteten Spot werden Spot, Datum, Dauer und Flugtyp geteilt — niemals deine GPS-Tracks oder Notizen. Flüge ohne verorteten Spot werden übersprungen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour chaque vol sur un spot localisé, cela partage le spot, la date, la durée et le type de vol — jamais tes traces GPS ni tes notes. Les vols sans spot localisé sont ignorés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forecast by Open-Meteo. %@. Dots rate the wind against the launch directions above.": {},
