    "iCloud Sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud-Sync"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisation iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud sync is coming in a future version — use Account & Cloud Backup below to save your logbook in the cloud meanwhile. Backups use the .paraflightlog format and include wings, flights, photos and GPS tracks. Import IGC / GPX Track turns tracks recorded by other vario apps into flights.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud-Sync kommt in einer späteren Version — nutze bis dahin „Konto & Cloud-Backup“ unten, um dein Logbuch in der Cloud zu sichern. Backups nutzen das .paraflightlog-Format und enthalten Schirme, Flüge, Fotos und GPS-Tracks. „IGC-/GPX-Track importieren“ wandelt Tracks anderer Vario-Apps in Flüge um."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La synchronisation iCloud arrivera dans une prochaine version — utilise Compte et sauvegarde cloud ci-dessous pour enregistrer ton carnet dans le cloud en attendant. Les sauvegardes utilisent le format .paraflightlog et incluent voiles, vols, photos et traces GPS. Importer une trace IGC / GPX transforme les traces enregistrées par d'autres apps de vario en vols."
          }
        }
      }
    },
