    "Removes shared flights that are no longer in this logbook — leftovers from deletes made before the app removed them for you. If you also log flights on another device, run this from the device that has them all.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes shared flights that are no longer in this logbook — leftovers from deletes made before the app removed them for you. If you also log flights on another device, run this from the device that has them all."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprime les vols partagés qui ne sont plus dans ce carnet — des restes de suppressions faites avant que l'app ne s'en charge. Si vous enregistrez aussi des vols sur un autre appareil, lancez ce nettoyage depuis celui qui les a tous."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entfernt geteilte Flüge, die nicht mehr in diesem Flugbuch sind — Überbleibsel von Löschungen, bevor die App das selbst übernahm. Wenn du auch auf einem anderen Gerät Flüge aufzeichnest, führe dies auf dem Gerät aus, das alle enthält."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to clean up — the community only has flights that are still in your logbook.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
